    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50858" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱπποφᾰές</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έος</span>,
			τό, a kind of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spurge, Euphorbia spinosa</i>, used for carding
			cloth, <i><span class="en">
				Asclep.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>Nat.Fac.</u>
				1.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.159
			</span></i> (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππόφαος</span></b> 
			ibid., <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱπποφανής</span></b>  Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
			</span></i>ibid.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			= sq., Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.160
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππόφεως</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.106
			</span></i>; as a drug, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.15.6
			</span></i>.</div>
